<title>USA: Salton/Maxim acquires giftware company.</title>
<headline>Salton/Maxim acquires giftware company.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNT PROSPECT, Ill. 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salton/Maxim Housewares Inc, a household and personal care appliances manufacturer, said Thursday it has acquired the assets of Jonal Crystal Ltd, an importer and distributor of glassware and crystal for the gift, tabletop and housewares industries.</p>
<p>Salton/Maxim said it acquired Jonal from Sterling Cut Glass of Erlanger, Ky.</p>
<p>Jonal had sales of about $2.2 million in 1996.</p>
<p>Terms of the cash acquisition were not disclosed.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
